OL,4,BInside the rise of 'humble' Nyoni and  
OL,5,Bwhy Iraola trusts him                  
OL,6,GTrey Nyoni knew this was the season    
OL,7,Gwhen opportunity beckoned for him at   
OL,8,GLiverpool.                             
OL,10,FWith Curtis Jones leaving for Inter    
OL,11,FMilan and the club deciding not to buy 
OL,12,Fanother midfielder, Nyoni saw the      
OL,13,Fprospect of regular first-team action  
OL,14,Fif he impressed new head coach Andoni  
OL,15,FIraola in pre-season.                  
